        },
        {
          "text": "oo waxay la yimaadeen Serubaabel, Yeeshuuca, Nexemyaah, Casaryaah, Racamyaah, Naxamaanii, Mordekay, Bilshaan, Misfered, Bigway, Nexuum, iyo Bacanaah. Haddaba waa tan tiradii dadkii reer binu Israa'iil: ",
          "type": "text",
