        {
          "text": "Oo kuwanuna waxay ahaayeen kuwii ka tegey Teel Melax, iyo Teel Xarshaa, iyo Keruub, iyo Addoon, iyo Immeer, laakiinse iyagu ma ay sheegi karin qabiilkoodii ama jilibkoodii, iyo inay reer binu Israa'iil ahaayeen iyo in kale toona, ",
