        },
        {
          "text": "Oo kuwii wadaaddada ahaa waxay ahaayeen reer Xaabaayaah, iyo reer Xaqoos, iyo reer Barsillay oo naag ka guursaday gabdhaha Gilecaad oo iyaga lagu magacaabay. ",
