            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwanu waxay magacyadoodii ka doondooneen buuggii abtiriska, laakiinse lagama helin, sidaas aawadeed wadaadnimadii waa laga saaray sidii iyagoo nijaas ah. ",
