          "items": [
            {
              "text": "65",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo taliyihii baa iyagii ku amray inayan waxyaalaha ugu quduusan wax ka cunin jeer wadaad Uuriim iyo Tummiim leh kaco. ",
